Subject: CPMS I03E4 Activation Source Topology Justification

@ [justification_uuid] 7873de44-12d7-4c51-8717-9c4e90f1f680
@ [canonical_specification_uuid] 7bcde4fa-e527-4841-88d7-97eb835f9a1a

& [Problem] formed I03 slices name overlapping lib.rs and conformance-report surfaces without one canonical ownership and integration order
  + direct implementation would risk a large mixed-responsibility module
  + parallel workers could edit the same exports fixtures or Cargo surfaces against stale predecessors
  + documentary formation order could be mistaken for executable dependency order

& [Decision] use exclusive semantic modules plus serialized mechanical integration ledgers
  + I03B C and D retain root modules matching their existing canonical source-touch clauses
  + I03E1 E2 E3 and E receive obligation proposal review and report child modules
  + lib.rs and conformance/mod.rs contain only declarations cfg gates and re-exports
  + prospective TouchLease and InterfaceReceipt forms make shared edits attributable and predecessor-bound

& [WhyNotMonolith] conformance_report.rs would mix grammar obligations proposal generation oracle authority review trust replay and final reporting
  + mixed change causality would weaken requirement mapping
  + independent review and testing would become less precise
  + source size alone is not the objection; semantic authority collapse is

& [WhyNotIndependentParallelActivation] D consumes A B and C while E1 E2 E3 and E form a hard causal chain
  + compile feasibility cannot substitute for active predecessor identity
  + shared ledgers also require exact successor order
  + disjoint research remains possible without claiming premature implementation

& [WhyFormationNow] the topology resolves an implementation ambiguity without crossing current blockers
  + all I03 behavior remains inactive
  + exact future source surfaces can be reviewed before authority is granted
  + the project gains a dependency-aware work breakdown instead of another undifferentiated idea layer

& [SecurityJustification] A-only Cargo custody no semantic logic in ledgers immutable fixture records and no runtime corpus I/O reduce capability leakage
& [HonestyJustification] explicit edge kinds completion conjunction and gate vocabulary prevent formation compile block and execution claims from collapsing
& [Cost] more modules receipts and serialized integration steps
& [Benefit] smaller reviews exact ownership causal recovery deterministic handoffs and reduced source collisions
& [AuthorityLimit] justification supports formation only and grants no lease implementation or activation
& [Disposition] is justified_for_canonical_formation
